  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021-2022 Framework Audit and Evaluations Bolivia - 2021-2022 Audit Services Bolivia BDO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">2021-2022 Revision och Evaluation Ram Avtal Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med detta bidrag &#xe4;r att utf&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;ljande typer av uppdrag: 1) F&#xf6;rhandsutdelning av institutionella bed&#xf6;mningar; 2) Finansiella revisioner, b&#xe5;de bestyrkandeuppdrag och &#xf6;verenskomna f&#xf6;rfaranden enligt internationella revisionsstandarder; 3) Andra typer av revisioner och granskningar; s&#xe5;som upphandlingsrevisioner, f&#xf6;rvaltningsrevisioner, effektivitetsrevisioner, kapacitets- och systemrevisioner, 4) &quot;Forensic audit&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this contribution is to carry out the following types of assignments 1) Pre-award Institutional Assessments; 2) Financial Audits, both assurance engagements and agreed upon procedures according to international standards of auditing; 3) Other kinds of audits and reviews; such as procurement audits, management audits, performance audits, capacity and systems audits, 4) Forensic audits</narrative>
  </description>
